g/blog/internet-regulation-fairness</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/saturday-assorted-links-528.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-528">Saturday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.cato.org/blog/internet-regulation-fairness</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.cato.org/blog/internet-regulation-fairness</guid><pubDate>Sat, 20 Sep 2025 15:55:32 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[one of these sentences is very wrong]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1532845681051766784/7tZ93175_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Christopher F. Rufo ⚔️ (@realchrisrufo) on X</p><p>Sorry, but the FCC was established by FDR to impose public standards on broadcasters and used by JFK to pressure station managers into dropping right-wing radio programs. The “shoe has been on the other foot” for almost a hundred years. Turnabout is fair play.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/realchrisrufo/status/1968776119005454596">https://x.com/realchrisrufo/status/1968776119005454596</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/saturday-assorted-links-528.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-528">Saturday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/realchrisrufo/status/1968776119005454596</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/realchrisrufo/status/1968776119005454596</guid><pubDate>Sat, 20 Sep 2025 15:55:32 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[None of these sentences are wrong]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1858509536341929984/BcbEG-S3_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Aaron Fritschner (@Fritschner) on X</p><p>It’s not just that Stoller and the monopoly people were obviously and stupidly wrong, the thing they were insanely wrong about turns out to be the key to how Trump is wielding government power against media, bu