title><![CDATA[Helen Andrews | Overcoming the Feminization of Culture | NatCon 5]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EWLbq7PlrIA">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EWLbq7PlrIA</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/some-links-9212025">Some Links, 9/21/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EWLbq7PlrIA</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EWLbq7PlrIA</guid><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 11:03:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Charlie Kirk and The Rise of Assassination Culture]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>American political life has crossed a dangerous threshold. Once universally condemned, assassination is, in widening corners of our culture, met not with horror, but with glee…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://paresky.substack.com/p/charlie-kirk-and-the-rise-of-assassination?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://paresky.substack.com/p/charlie-kirk-and-the-rise-of-assassination?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/some-links-9222025">Psychology and Politics Links Links, 9/22/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://paresky.substack.com/p/charlie-kirk-and-the-rise-of-assassination?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://paresky.substack.com/p/charlie-kirk-and-the-rise-of-assassination?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 11:04:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Thuggistry]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>There’s a joke about academic degrees that goes like this…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://thelivingfossils.substack.com/p/thuggistry?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://thelivingfossils.substack.com/p/thuggistry?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/some-links-9222025">Psychology and Politics Links Links, 9/22/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://thelivingfossils.substack.com/p/thuggistry?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://thelivingfossils.substack.com/p/thuggistry?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 11:04:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Which conservatism?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>That institutions within Western democracies have deteriorated in recent decades is clear. That the march of progressivism through the institutions is at the heart of this deterioration is also clear…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.lorenzofromoz.net/p/which-conservatism?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.lorenzofromoz.net/p/which-conservatism?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/some-links-9222025">Psychology and Politics Links Links, 9/22/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.lorenzofromoz.net/p/which-conservatism?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.lorenzofromoz.net/p/which-conservatism?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 11:04:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why constructive engagement is rare]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Constructive engagement is rare, not just in political seasons, not just in our society, but always and everywhere, for good evolutionary reasons. Understanding those reasons gives us a fighting chance to avoid useless fighting and begin constructive engagement…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.nessays.com/p/why-constructive-engagement-is-rare?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">htt